{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0280_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0280_story_03_title", "source_sha256": "f1128ddb6c3c36b7d0000e50d766849ebe3ec511613b1c5a32b8962d6d772756", "ja": "暗く輝く星", "zh": "暗淡闪烁的星", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0280_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0280_story_03_synopsis", "source_sha256": "64a6f2f7308b21230beb1673e6f0fa9f2593069ac21dd9b3ec24d70d49acb3e8", "ja": "監獄星の主・トモカは『大いなる星の意志』\nの力を利用し、再び宇宙に戦争を起こそうと\nしていた。死んだはずのクイーン・エミリー\n生存の噂を耳にしたトモカは、元連合軍所属\nの傭兵・マツリを調査に向かわせる。", "zh": "监狱星之主·朋花利用“伟大的星之意志”\n的力量，企图再次在宇宙中引发战争。\n听闻本应已经死去的艾米莉女王仍然生还的传闻后，\n朋花派遣原联合军所属的佣兵·茉莉前去调查。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0280_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0280_story_03_1000_null", "source_sha256": "93dce82dfb8ee31c24c98ee17c0ae54500229b332ed67f305a92519d4a48b4d5", "ja": "太陽系内、元エイリアン支配宙域……監獄星。\n難攻不落、脱出不能と恐れられた、宇宙刑務所。", "zh": "太阳系内，原外星人支配宇域……监狱星。\n令人闻风丧胆的宇宙监狱，固若金汤、插翅难逃。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0280_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0280_story_03_1001_null", "source_sha256": "70d1ddc2a0e43487534005a21d664a29a3f2ee5afe5cc658ff562410e579b59c", "ja": "『大いなる星の意志』を宿したトモカの歌の力により、\nそこには今、続々と戦力が集結しつつあった……。", "zh": "凭借寄宿着《伟大星辰意志》的朋花的歌声力量，战力正不断集结于此……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0280_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0280_story_03_1002_031tom", "source_sha256": "474fbdd68d9bc7c8f9b92cb104d151ee0ed323c08da0584916ee9edbcb2690b7", "ja": "今日も私の歌、聴いてくれてありがと～！\n次の太陽フレア通信をお楽しみに～☆", "zh": "今天也谢谢你来听我的歌～！\n敬请期待下一期太阳耀斑通讯哦～☆", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0280_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0280_story_03_1003_031tom", "source_sha256": "6947de97bf65c8e2e597effd92a12460b1581755ffc8ab4ba66d17a0fb9233c9", "ja": "騎士団員は、まだまだブラックホール級に大募集中！\n監獄星で待ってるよ～！　じゃあね～☆", "zh": "骑士团成员还在黑洞级别地大量招募中！\n我会在监狱星等着你们哦～！那就再见啦～☆", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0280_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0280_story_03_1004_021mat", "source_sha256": "20a400a8cc073710304a8fa51898f4b1140e8e1fb0b1b4f85fdb40b9fb15e83d", "ja": "……毎度のことながら、\nその猫のかぶりようには感心するな。", "zh": "……虽然是常有的事了，\n但你装乖的本事还真叫人佩服啊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0280_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0280_story_03_1005_031tom", "source_sha256": "c5945cf125bf6728f5ca4c8258ecbb12dd2457b6fe5c02ae7b4ee49e2be218c6", "ja": "こほんっ。必要だからやっているだけよ。\n革命を成し遂げるための手段に過ぎないわ。", "zh": "咳咳。只是因为有必要才这么做而已。\n这不过是为了实现革命的手段罢了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0280_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0280_story_03_1006_021mat", "source_sha256": "17f88c71b88b6ca1d1ad3bd2b73a544ab669965ce53bc276be5e418cd44e646e", "ja": "革命……エイリアン母星からの独立、か。\n私は、戦場さえ与えられるのなら何でも構わないが。", "zh": "革命……从外星人的母星独立吗。我倒是无所谓，只要能给我战场就行。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0280_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0280_story_03_1007_031tom", "source_sha256": "e4e3f676a9e8826fc4c567c281543c7817ca26b4fcd4fba973906c8592b13463", "ja": "あなたも、たまには私と歌ったり、\n踊ったりしてみたら？　意外と人気出るかも。", "zh": "你也偶尔试着和我一起唱唱歌、跳跳舞怎么样？说不定意外地会受欢迎哦。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0280_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0280_story_03_1008_021mat", "source_sha256": "bec9c53f00a0002890c273b84039cb775149ffd2190dd567282e5840cfb04908", "ja": "それは契約外だな。\n私が売ったのは、戦闘技術だけだ。", "zh": "那可不在契约范围内。  \n我卖的只有战斗技术。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0280_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0280_story_03_1009_031tom", "source_sha256": "25f7b53d30b0ae2600b6907c201a1cb2756d1909468a49d6de543ee193223d58", "ja": "ふぅん……まあいいわ。それより、\nクイーン・エミリーの死体が見つからないの。", "zh": "嗯……那就算了。比起这个，艾米莉女王的尸体还没找到呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0280_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0280_story_03_1010_031tom", "source_sha256": "ed998eb7749aac88533f4f62d824bff179d2042d8a25ae1bb082a88516b6ded5", "ja": "ある民間船によって回収されたという噂もあるわ。\n誰かが調べに行ってくれたら、嬉しいんだけどな～？", "zh": "也有传闻说，是被某艘民间船只打捞走了。\n要是有人愿意去调查一下，我会很高兴的～？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0280_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0280_story_03_1011_021mat", "source_sha256": "5a13e6a3b4ded17c7359e3eae4d6d0c0b748d0c06b0b67f8ec891d6424751aed", "ja": "そうか。いい人材が見つかるといいな。", "zh": "这样啊。希望能找到合适的人选就好了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0280_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0280_story_03_1012_031tom", "source_sha256": "c0d26d0e9934e2278856447c4b0993cfbcfa4c7220649a6adc97c932758a744a", "ja": "……。\nあ・な・たに言っているんだけど～？　マツリさ～ん？", "zh": "……。\n我是在对·你·说哦～？茉莉小～姐？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0280_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0280_story_03_1013_021mat", "source_sha256": "47da68f23962e8e1efa95d9d5487a8ee53d674c262fce1701b017b72dfbc84bc", "ja": "命令は、正確に入力してもらいたいところだが。\nまあいい、了解した。", "zh": "虽然希望你能准确输入命令。\n不过也罢，了解。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
